   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>弹型穿深受岩石和围压影响，仿真存在标定偏差。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>仿真样本、岩石强度、围压与少量实验标签。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>修正模拟穿深并显示误差范围。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='射孔孔道形态与靶试示意'><text x='20' y='22' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>射孔孔道：只能「打出来」的形态</text><rect x='40' y='64' width='330' height='150' fill='#e9eef6' stroke='#c9d4e4'/><rect x='160' y='26' width='52' height='30' rx='4' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='186' y='45' font-size='9' fill='#fff' text-anchor='middle'>射孔弹</text><ellipse cx='186' cy='125' rx='40' ry='72' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.08' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3' stroke-opacity='.6'/><path d='M176,56 C168,100 162,138 170,182 L198,182 C212,140 208,96 198,56 Z' fill='#d47a3a' fill-opacity='.3' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1'/><path d='M182,60 C176,100 172,136 178,178 L190,178 C198,138 196,98 190,60 Z' fill='#fff'/><line x1='142' y1='92' x2='100' y2='72' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='.8' opacity='.5'/><line x1='230' y1='100' x2='268' y2='80' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='.8' opacity='.5'/><line x1='146' y1='160' x2='108' y2='180' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='.8' opacity='.5'/><text x='266' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51'>放射状裂纹</text><text x='186' y='58' font-size='8' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle'> </text><line x1='252' y1='56' x2='252' y2='182' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='247' y1='56' x2='257' y2='56' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='247' y1='182' x2='257' y2='182' stroke='#52627a' stroke-width='1'/><text x='258' y='124' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a'>穿深 Lp</text><text x='205' y='232' font-size='9' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>靶试：混凝土/砂岩靶（已知强度 UCS）</text><line x1='396' y1='30' x2='396' y2='240' stroke='#dfe6f0' stroke-width='1'/><text x='546' y='44' font-size='10' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38' text-anchor='middle'>靶后 CT / 铸体：孔道真值</text><path d='M500,84 C518,60 574,58 594,82 C612,102 610,158 588,178 C566,196 518,194 502,172 C488,152 486,102 500,84 Z' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.2'/><ellipse cx='548' cy='132' rx='16' ry='46' fill='#fff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1' transform='rotate(8 548 132)'/><text x='548' y='130' font-size='8.5' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>空腔</text><line x1='596' y1='158' x2='624' y2='176' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1'/><text x='626' y='180' font-size='8.5' fill='#b05a51'>压实带</text><text x='546' y='226' font-size='9.5' fill='#52627a' text-anchor='middle' font-family='monospace'>实测穿深 0.62 m · 孔径 12.4 mm</text></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
